1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,705
Part two. Getting started.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:08,220
Open the SuryaSetu website in Chrome, Edge or Safari.

3
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:11,890
The first time, it asks you to create an account.

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:16,384
The person who creates it becomes the admin of the business.

5
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:20,710
Type your name, email and 10-digit mobile number,

6
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:25,596
then choose a password of at least eight characters and type it again.

7
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,331
Tap Create account.

8
00:00:29,331 --> 00:00:31,150
You get a recovery code.

9
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:37,216
Write it down or take a photo and keep it safe: it lets the admin back in if the

10
00:00:37,216 --> 00:00:39,263
password is ever forgotten.

11
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:43,211
Tick that you have saved the code and continue.

12
00:00:43,211 --> 00:00:46,576
You are in, on the Home screen of your own business.

13
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:53,212
To sign out, open the account menu at the top right and choose Sign out.

14
00:00:53,212 --> 00:00:57,344
Next time, pick your account and type your password.

15
00:00:57,344 --> 00:00:58,138
Forgot it?

16
00:00:58,138 --> 00:01:01,476
Use Forgot password on the sign-in screen.

17
00:01:02,370 --> 00:01:07,709
To install it like an app: on Android, open the website in Chrome,

18
00:01:07,709 --> 00:01:11,430
tap the three-dot menu and choose Install app.

19
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:15,151
On iPhone, use Share, then Add to Home Screen.

20
00:01:15,151 --> 00:01:19,762
On a computer, click the install icon in the address bar.

21
00:01:19,762 --> 00:01:23,968
Your company can also give you the Android app file.

22
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:31,017
Next video: Company setup: profile, GST, print, WhatsApp.

